    <item>
      <title>数据精耕：UCSD DreamPRM-1.5如何以“样本智能”重塑多模态AI推理的信任与商业版图</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/ucsd-dreamprm-15ai-20250919151007218-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 19 Sep 2025 15:10:07 +0800</pubDate>
